1
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,315
"Contributors from forks could not see
coverage on their pull requests because the

2
00:00:09,355 --> 00:00:14,170
token is missing there. This switches CI
to the trigger that has secrets, adds the

3
00:00:14,210 --> 00:00:18,907
coverage uploader and a comment, moves CI
