5
00:00:23,095 --> 00:00:27,325
Read it again as a reviewer. It's
friendly. It solves a real problem.

6
00:00:27,365 --> 00:00:32,400
It saves money. Every clause of it describes
something this part of the course has

7
00:00:32,440 --> 00:00:35,556
